Set date Italian
Use STUD

Index on IIF(MONTH(dr) = 5 .OR. MONTH(dr) = 9, 1, 0) to STUD_Exotic
Set index to STUD_Exotic
Set softseek on

Seek 1

? "Родившиеся в мае или сентябре:"
Do while !Eof() .and. IIF(MONTH(dr) = 5 .OR. MONTH(dr) = 9, 1, 0) = 1
   ? fio, dr
   Skip
Enddo

Set softseek off
Set index to
